## 正确代码片段

```java
class Dog extends Soldier {
    // 一个方法，统一入口
    @Override
    protected int calculateSoldierDamage(GameObject target) {
        // 运行时判断：我是狗，我对人类特殊
        if (target instanceof Soldier && !(target instanceof Dog)) {
            return target.getHealth();  // 一口毙命
        }
        return this.attackPower;  // 普通伤害
    }
}

class RifleSoldier extends Soldier {
    @Override
    protected int calculateSoldierDamage(GameObject target) {
        // 运行时判断：我是步枪兵，我对军犬特殊
        if (target instanceof Dog) {
            return target.getHealth();  // 一击必杀
        }
        return this.attackPower;
    }
}
```

